# away the answers to the 11 challenges. If you add a file here, check it
# against this list first.
#
# The complete reference implementation:
shadow_hadamard_challenge_RUN.ipynb
*_RUN.ipynb
*_SOLUTION.ipynb
*_solutions.ipynb

# Outputs of a solved run: the recovered spectrum, weights, symmetry
# labels, DFT ratios and resource table are the deliverables participants
# are supposed to derive themselves.
figures/
run_summary.json

# Any locally executed copy of the participant notebook — it will contain
# the participant's own (or the reference) answers in its outputs.
*_executed.ipynb
executed.ipynb
*_asis.ipynb
shadow_hadamard_challenge_PARTICIPANT_solved.ipynb

